Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.99,0:04:10.06,Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(747,500)\shad3\fnArial Rounded MT Bold\fs50\pos(318,145)}「The Way Home」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.41,0:00:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's stay a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.63,0:00:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should be in bed already.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not even tired yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You go on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.59,0:00:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall I take you somewhere nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.61,0:00:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Somewhere nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we take a small detour?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.93,0:00:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, you're heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't hurt him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:00:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you even have a fish tank at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.34,0:00:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No. But we have the bathtub!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.27,0:01:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When you get home, put some tap water in a bucket and set it out on the veranda.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.39,0:01:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because tap water has chlorine and stuff in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.53,0:01:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.49,0:01:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.97,0:01:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.54,0:01:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're gonna leave you behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.95,0:01:41.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't hurt him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.21,0:01:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, a river!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.46,0:01:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm coming too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.36,0:02:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There are places like this nearby, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this the first time you've brought Rin-chan here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. It's my first summer with her, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.51,0:02:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's too dark. I can't see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, tell us where to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Check over that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.67,0:02:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.71,0:02:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's already evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.32,0:03:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but it seemed like they wanted to keep playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.85,0:03:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds like someone else we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.71,0:03:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, we're this way, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.01,0:03:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See ya later!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goodnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we get going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've become taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.75,0:04:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
